---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Legal notice" lang="en" description="Legal notice and privacy policy for the Bitaqat Hifd Qor'an site.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-gold-600">Information</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink-900 dark:text-white">Legal notice</h1>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-600 dark:text-ink-300">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-ink-900 dark:text-white">Site publisher</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          This site is published on a non-commercial basis by the Bitaqat Hifd Qor'an project, as part of the
          free, open distribution of a pedagogical kit to help memorize the Qur'an.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-ink-900 dark:text-white">Hosting</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          This site is hosted by Cloudflare, Inc. (Cloudflare Workers), 101 Townsend St, San Francisco, CA 94107,
          United States.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-ink-900 dark:text-white">Personal data and cookies</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          This site does not use any tracking or advertising cookies. Audience measurement, when enabled, relies
          on Cloudflare Web Analytics, a solution that sets no cookies and collects no personally identifiable
          data.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2">
          No personal data is collected by this site beyond what you may voluntarily provide through the contact
          form. This data will never be sold, shared or transferred to third parties, and will only be kept for
          as long as needed to answer your request.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-ink-900 dark:text-white">Intellectual property and licence</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Downloadable content (recitation cards, tracking tools, methodology documents) is the property of the
          Bitaqat Hifd Qor'an project and is made available under the
          <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/" class="text-gold-600 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Creative Commons BY-NC 4.0</a>
          licence: free sharing and adaptation, provided the original credit is kept and no commercial use is
          made. Any other reproduction of the site's content requires prior authorisation.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-ink-900 dark:text-white">Your rights</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          In accordance with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), you have the right to access,
          rectify and delete your data. This right may be exercised through the site's contact form.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
